// real user-facing routing. Exists to isolate exactly which layer is
// failing when a live-tenant auth attempt goes wrong: token acquisition
// itself (app-registration/consent/platform-type issues) vs. a specific
// Graph scope (Sites.Selected/User.ReadBasic.All/Chat.*/Mail.Send)
// vs. a specific site's Sites.Selected grant. All real work happens in
// entry-diag.ts, which reuses the app's actual authProvider.ts/GraphClient
// code so this tests the real code path, not a reimplementation.
---
